as some tips and offers to make it easier for you."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/1280x853/0ee6170e09/how-to-keep-your-house-clean.webp"/><meta name="twitter:image:width" content="280"/><meta name="twitter:image:height" content="280"/><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="How to Keep Your Home Clean? "/><link rel="icon" href="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/x/a043724372/jl-favicon.ico"/><script>document.querySelectorAll('body link[rel="icon"], body link[rel="apple-touch-icon"]').forEach(el => document.head.appendChild(el))</script><script src="/blog/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class="Header_headerContainer__RZem_"><div class="Header_headerWrapper__xLzp9"><a target="_self" class="Header_logoWrapper__8YDWS" href="/blog/en-AE"><img alt="logo" fetchPriority="auto" loading="eager" width="170" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="Header_logoImage__wL82F" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:7.083333333333333" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/173x24/7981607c7b/cleanslate-logo.svg"/><p class="Header_brandName__Mwg9r">by Justlife</p></a><a hrefLang="ar-AE" target="_self" class="Chip_chipContainer__KMeax Chip_default__xuX8i LanguageSwitchButton_languageSwitchButton__wZ1IW" href="/blog/ar-AE/how-to-keep-your-home-clean"><p class="text-subtitle-1 text-white g-inline-block">العربية</p></a></div></div><div id="blogdetail-page-container"><div class="bg-white g-flow-root"><div class="BreadcrumbGroup_breadcrumbGroupContainer__w36yz"><a class="Breadcrumb_breadcrumbItem__D7J_f  text-subtitle-1" href="https://www.justlife.com/en-AE">Home</a><img alt="chevron-right" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" width="8" height="12" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="BreadcrumbGroup_breadcrumbIcon__Qxy6t rtl-flip" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:0.6666666666666666" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/7x10/bed1910ac4/chevron-right.svg"/><a class="Breadcrumb_breadcrumbItem__D7J_f  text-subtitle-1" href="/blog/en-AE">Blog</a><img alt="chevron-right" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" width="8" height="12" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="BreadcrumbGroup_breadcrumbIcon__Qxy6t rtl-flip" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:0.6666666666666666" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/7x10/bed1910ac4/chevron-right.svg"/><a class="Breadcrumb_breadcrumbItem__D7J_f Breadcrumb_disabled__4ca9w text-subtitle-1" href="/blog/en-AE/how-to-keep-your-home-clean">How to Keep Your Home Clean?</a></div><div class="HighlightSection_highlightContainer__lVTle"><div class="HighlightSection_highlightSectionTextSection__Pk59k"><h1 class="HighlightSection_highlightTitle__WwNfj">How to Keep Your Home Clean?</h1><p class="HighlightSection_highlightDescription__CwibP">Is your home getting messy and no matter how hard you clean it and you cannot figure out a way how to keep your house clean? Luckily, Justlife has some tips and offers to make it easier for you.</p><div class="HighlightSection_bookNowContainer__P1EZr"><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardContainer__P7nfG"><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardLogoWrapper__xLuMU"><img alt="justlife-logo" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" width="140" height="44" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="BookNowCard_bookNowLogo__onpra" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:3.1818181818181817" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/140x45/86979fd21d/justlife-logo-blue.svg"/></div><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardDescriptionWrapper__oTOKg"><p class="">Need things sorted fast? Book UAE’s favorite home services on Justlife.</p></div><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardButtonWrapper__FmEn6"><a href="https://www.justlife.com/en-AE/home-cleaning/checkout/details?utm_source=BlogPost&amp;utm_campaign=how-to-keep-your-home-clean" target="_blank" class="BookNowCard_bookNowButton__UxmTi text-body-1">Book now</a></div></div></div></div><div class="HighlightSection_highlightImageWrapper__j4SaC"><img alt="highlight-img" fetchPriority="high" loading="eager" width="359" height="333" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="HighlightSection_highlightImage__jXtae" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:1.078078078078078" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/1280x853/0ee6170e09/how-to-keep-your-house-clean.webp/m/680x453/filters:format(webp)"/></div></div><div class="BookNowSection_bookNowContainer__Bi7B5"><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardContainer__P7nfG"><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardLogoWrapper__xLuMU"><img alt="justlife-logo" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" width="140" height="44" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="BookNowCard_bookNowLogo__onpra" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:3.1818181818181817" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/140x45/86979fd21d/justlife-logo-blue.svg"/></div><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardDescriptionWrapper__oTOKg"><p class="">Need things sorted fast? Book UAE’s favorite home services on Justlife.</p></div><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardButtonWrapper__FmEn6"><a href="https://www.justlife.com/en-AE/home-cleaning/checkout/details?utm_source=BlogPost&amp;utm_campaign=how-to-keep-your-home-clean" target="_blank" class="BookNowCard_bookNowButton__UxmTi text-body-1">Book now</a></div></div></div><div class="ContentSection_contentSectionContainer__7lYFU"><p>Is your home getting messy and no matter how hard you clean it and you cannot figure out a way <strong>how to keep your house clean</strong>? No matter how many people you are living with, house cleaning is a periodical duty that most of the time becomes boring. In order not to make it as boring, it is useful to keep your house clean at all times. Luckily, Justlife has some tips and offers to make it easier for you.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>1. Make the Bed First</strong></h2><p>Some people believe that making the bed is a waste of time, yet it makes a significant difference in the appearance of the room and only takes a few minutes. Plus, It is believed that it's a nice way to start the day, and people enjoy slipping into a freshly made bed at the end of the day. Simplify your bedding as much as possible to make things easy. We ended up ripping out our top sheets (which usually ended up in a large puddle at the end of the bed) and replacing them with a duvet and washable cover. If you prefer your top sheets, consider reducing the number of pillows on your bed or buying a large enough cover or duvet to eliminate the need to tuck your sheets in.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>2. Prioritize</strong></h2><p>Cleaning isn't all made equal. Make a list of everything you want to accomplish, then prioritize what must be accomplished and what can wait until the following day or two. Write out your top 2 or 3 realistic! cleaning objectives, based on the time you have available, and adhere to them before moving on to other tasks.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>3. Involve the Whole Family</strong></h2><p>Yes, it is often faster to just do the job yourself, but taking the time to educate your children on how to do age-appropriate tasks can benefit both of you in the long term. Begin by encouraging your children to clean up after themselves — putting their coats and shoes away as they enter the home, putting dishes in the dishwasher, cleaning their rooms, and so on – and gradually adding extra jobs as they are able. It's astonishing how much of a difference these small items can make in the general tidiness of the house. You'll probably have to keep an eye on your kids for the first few weeks, but this will become a habit for them as well, and you should ultimately be able to do it with minimum reminders.<br>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>4. Consider Getting Help From Professionals&nbsp;</strong></h2><p><strong>How to keep house clean</strong> is a thing that revolves in our minds daily. Involving the whole family might not work for everyone since not everyone lives with their families. In any case, in which you do not have anyone to help you, you might consider getting cleaning services. Of course, since these companies are the people who you’ll trust with your house, pay attention to the <a href="https://www.justlife.com/en-AE/house-cleaning-dubai">cleaning company</a> you choose. If you have questions about the services and companies, you can surely trust Justlife on seeing your house as their own and caring for it. Whether it is your kitchen, living room, bedroom, or even specifically your sofas or curtains, Justlife can take care of any and all cleaning needs you may have. You’ll be saving time and money with Justlife. Save time for life, with Justlife.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For the service areas we operate, kindly visit: <a href="https://www.justlife.com/en-AE/house-cleaning-dubai">Home Cleaning Services Dubai</a>, <a href="https://www.justlife.com/en-AE/house-cleaning-abu-dhabi">Home Cleaning Services Abu Dhabi</a>, <a href="https://www.justlife.com/en-AE/house-cleaning-sharjah">Home Cleaning Services Sharjah</a>, <a href="https://www.justlife.com/en-AE/house-cleaning-ajman">Home Cleaning Services Ajman</a>.</p></div><div class="FeaturedSection_featuredContainer__8U5Xt"><h2 class="">Featured Articles</h2><div class="FeaturedSection_blogCardWrapper__mrozQ"><a target="_self" class="BlogCard_blogCarContainer__4mbWt BlogCard_medium__eY9iQ" href="/blog/en-AE/how-to-deep-clean-a-kitchen"><div class="BlogCard_blogCardImageWrapper__zvIpf"><img alt="blog-image" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" width="408" height="220" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="BlogCard_blogImage__70GAU BlogCard_medium__eY9iQ" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:1.8545454545454545" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/1536x1024/651b432a59/how-to-deep-clean-kitchen.webp/m/680x453/filters:format(webp)"/></div><h3 class="BlogCard_blogCardTitle__F8eRV ">How To Deep Clean The Kitchen? Kitchen Deep Cleaning Checklist</h3><p class="BlogCard_blogCardDescription__P9zo5">Follow this step-by-step kitchen deep cleaning checklist and learn how to deep clean your kitchen like a pro or book expert today.</p></a><a target="_self" class="BlogCard_blogCarContainer__4mbWt BlogCard_medium__eY9iQ" href="/blog/en-AE/what-does-a-deep-cleaning-include"><div class="BlogCard_blogCardImageWrapper__zvIpf"><img alt="blog-image" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" width="408" height="220" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="BlogCard_blogImage__70GAU BlogCard_medium__eY9iQ" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:1.8545454545454545" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/1536x1024/e9153014f4/how-to-deep-clean.webp/m/680x453/filters:format(webp)"/></div><h3 class="BlogCard_blogCardTitle__F8eRV ">What Does A Deep Cleaning Include? How It Is Done?</h3><p class="BlogCard_blogCardDescription__P9zo5">Discover what deep cleaning includes, how it is done room by room, and why professional deep cleaning services are worth it.</p></a><a target="_self" class="BlogCard_blogCarContainer__4mbWt BlogCard_medium__eY9iQ" href="/blog/en-AE/what-is-aromatherapy-massage"><div class="BlogCard_blogCardImageWrapper__zvIpf"><img alt="blog-image" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" width="408" height="220" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="BlogCard_blogImage__70GAU BlogCard_medium__eY9iQ" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:1.8545454545454545" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/1536x1024/42bc63e1b8/aromatherapy-massage.webp/m/680x453/filters:format(webp)"/></div><h3 class="BlogCard_blogCardTitle__F8eRV ">Aromatherapy Massage: What It Is &amp; How It Works</h3><p class="BlogCard_blogCardDescription__P9zo5">Learn what aromatherapy massage is, how essential oils work with massage therapy, key benefits, safety tips, and what to expect from a session.</p></a><a target="_self" class="BlogCard_blogCarContainer__4mbWt BlogCard_medium__eY9iQ" href="/blog/en-AE/public-holiday-long-weekends-schedule"><div class="BlogCard_blogCardImageWrapper__zvI